i di protezione individuale possono trasformarsi rapidamente in situazioni pericolose. Imparate a riconoscere tempestivamente i pericoli e ad agire in modo sicuro.", "short_description": "Scoprite la sicurezza sul lavoro nell'edilizia in legno in modo virtuale e realistico: riconoscere i rischi tipici, reagire correttamente, senza alcun pericolo di lesioni. Imparate a evitare errori e a utilizzare in modo sicuro utensili e moduli."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Querformat.png", "id": "1735425970481901", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1735425973815234_7026648888461368653_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3vy5gayGBv8Q7kNvwHd4gAS&_nc_oc=AdqyunuIJeUwIU-FgMfVQ7gOBmX2_N0TGaA67WhN7bKCkhNVCjWPp0srNQy3Yzdyloc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSCVdrg3HgWkaL9QQ-SRlx1tKz69925bH-s_EGyTkWPyw&oe=6AF34FE3"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1404469407857988", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1404469411191321_2374008257608234867_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Gn_q8cxob80Q7kNvwFb5I17&_nc_oc=AdqNoazTDupc9_JGZ0OeHZU8nt04rXauHZAFC5_pcOUlifrm_9L4DUkQtEfJ5bphOmw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTFgbiqNiTMfbDGtdO9pWZ9wH-OQdcLwXYqMZq5A1ZLRA&oe=6AF33BDD"}, {"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Hochformat.png", "id": "1138371601691473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1138371605024806_6545105809583793091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bpo9hK8Y2z8Q7kNvwHdGVK3&_nc_oc=AdpOSheAPhWy6AtUqYsyJ1VB9nYjzdZ4Uw9e3XrcsARx0vLpUfgzoH5O8xDBGgcxFaQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRnUiUb-B8vpmDikcDw9UAVGk-p-Osu1iQ7WB6EZf4oOQ&oe=6AF32A4A"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1061729109131103", "im